# LF everywhere, whatever core.autocrlf says. Windows git otherwise checks
# out CRLF, and the first Windows CI run (2026-10-04) then failed "suite does
# not touch real sketches": hello.coffee came back at 785 bytes, its LF size,
# because the editor rewrote the CRLF copy with LF endings.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
